7. THE SIGNIFICANCE CLAIM, STATED EXPLICITLY
============================================================================================
MAIN SPEC: adjusted SES coef = -0.2316 (SE 0.1005, z = -2.31), 95% CI [-0.4286, -0.0347], p = 0.0211
   -> at alpha = .05 : REJECTED the null, i.e. still nominally SIGNIFICANT (borderline)
   -> at alpha = .01 : NOT rejected, i.e. INSIGNIFICANT
